Name: MOLE Protocol & Split HTTP Transport Core (mole-core)
Short Name: mole-core
URL: https://github.com/Moderation-of-unLinkable-Endorsements/internet-drafts
Version: 0.3.0
License: BSD-3-Clause
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Memory-safe (`#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`) Rust wire codecs, RFC 9651 Structured
Field HTTP headers (`Mole-Challenge`, `Sec-Mole-Authorization`,
`Sec-Mole-Grease`, `Mole-Info`), Split Moderation & Redemption binary POST
envelopes (`Issue`, `Present`, `Settle`), `ClearanceToken` wire codecs,
`draft-jms-mole-http-transport-01` inline headers, and `/.well-known/` JSON
configuration validators built atop `//third_party/mole_p256_rs`.

Local Modifications:
First-party Chromium integration crate.
